cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use NPOV-Onset or this code, please cite it as below."
title: "NPOV-Onset: a dated benchmark of neutral-point-of-view dispute onsets on English Wikipedia"
abstract: >-
  A dated benchmark of ~2,000 English Wikipedia neutral-point-of-view (NPOV)
  dispute onsets, each localised by binary search to the exact revision that
  introduced the maintenance template, paired with topically and
  activity-matched never-tagged controls. Released with the code for a
  seven-stage lead-time evaluation of whether articles drift away from
  neutrality before they are flagged.
type: dataset
